    "A bright Moon hides all but the brightest meteors.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein heller Mond überstrahlt alle Meteore außer den hellsten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bright Moon hides all but the brightest meteors."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una Luna brillante oculta todos los meteoros salvo los más brillantes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une Lune brillante masque tous les météores sauf les plus brillants."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月が明るいと、ごく明るい流星しか見えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A dark area": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine dunkle Gegend"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A dark area"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una zona oscura"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une zone sombre"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暗い地域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A faint dimming": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine leichte Verdunklung"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A faint dimming"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un leve oscurecimiento"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un léger assombrissement"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "わずかに暗くなる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A very faint, broad glow opposite the Sun, around %@, %lld° up in the %@. Only from the darkest skies, with eyes fully adapted; easy to miss.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein sehr schwacher, breiter Schein gegenüber der Sonne, gegen %1$@, %2$lld° hoch im %3$@. Nur unter den dunkelsten Himmeln, mit voll angepassten Augen; leicht zu übersehen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A very faint, broad glow opposite the Sun, around %@, %lld° up in the %@. Only from the darkest skies, with eyes fully adapted; easy to miss."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un resplandor muy tenue y amplio en el lado opuesto al Sol (aprox. %1$@), a %2$lld° de altura en el %3$@. Solo desde los cielos más oscuros, con la vista totalmente adaptada; fácil de pasar por alto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une lueur très faible et étendue à l’opposé du Soleil, vers %1$@, à %2$lld° de hauteur direction %3$@. Seulement sous les ciels les plus sombres, les yeux bien adaptés ; facile à manquer."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太陽と反対側に見える、ごく淡く広がった光。%1$@ごろ、%3$@の空、高度%2$lld°。最も暗い空で、目が十分に慣れたときだけ。見落としやすい光です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A weak return from this park; a rough guide.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von diesem Park aus eine schwache Ausbeute; eine grobe Orientierung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A weak return from this park; a rough guide."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Poca actividad desde este parque; una guía aproximada."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Peu de météores attendus depuis ce parc ; à titre indicatif."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この公園からは少ししか見えません。目安です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ away, so a little larger and brighter than most Full Moons. Its light hides all but the brightest stars.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etwa %@ entfernt, also etwas größer und heller als die meisten Vollmonde. Sein Licht verbirgt alle außer den hellsten Sternen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About %@ away, so a little larger and brighter than most Full Moons. Its light hides all but the brightest stars."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A unos %@, así que algo más grande y brillante que la mayoría de las lunas llenas. Su luz oculta todas las estrellas salvo las más brillantes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À environ %@, donc un peu plus grande et plus lumineuse que la plupart des pleines lunes. Sa lumière masque toutes les étoiles sauf les plus brillantes."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地球から約%@と近く、ふつうの満月より少し大きく明るく見えます。その光で、明るい星以外は見えなくなります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ of the sky this hour": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etwa %@ des Himmels in dieser Stunde"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About %@ of the sky this hour"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerca del %@ del cielo en esta hora"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environ %@ du ciel à cette heure"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この時間は空の約%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ of the sky, an early look counted as it stands": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etwa %@ des Himmels, eine erste Einschätzung, unverändert gezählt"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About %@ of the sky, an early look counted as it stands"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerca del %@ del cielo, una vista anticipada contada tal cual"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environ %@ du ciel, une tendance comptée telle quelle"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空の約%@。そのまま計算した早めの見通し"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %@ of the sky, an early look eased toward usual clouds": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Etwa %@ des Himmels, eine erste Einschätzung, an die übliche Bewölkung angenähert"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About %@ of the sky, an early look eased toward usual clouds"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cerca del %@ del cielo, una vista anticipada ajustada hacia la nubosidad habitual"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environ %@ du ciel, une tendance rapprochée de la nébulosité habituelle"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空の約%@。平年の雲量に寄せた早めの見通し"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About %lld in 10 %@ nights here are mostly clear.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Im %2$@ sind hier etwa %1$lld von 10 Nächten überwiegend klar."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About %lld in 10 %@ nights here are mostly clear."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unas %lld de cada 10 noches de %@ aquí están mayormente despejadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environ %lld nuits de %@ sur 10 sont ici plutôt dégagées."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここでは%2$@の夜の10回に約%1$lld回は、おおむね晴れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Access not checked. Confirm closures with the park.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zugang nicht geprüft. Erkundige dich beim Park nach Sperrungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Access not checked. Confirm closures with the park."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Acceso sin verificar. Confirma los cierres con el parque."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accès non vérifié. Vérifiez les fermetures auprès du parc."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アクセスは未確認です。閉鎖情報は公園に確認してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ahead is %@, not your room's real north.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vor dir liegt %@, nicht der echte Norden deines Raums."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ahead is %@, not your room's real north."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Al frente está el %@, no el norte real de tu habitación."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Devant vous : %@, pas le vrai nord de votre pièce."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正面は%@です。部屋の実際の北ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alerts for all %lld U.S. national parks arrive in one request to developer.nps.gov, at most every six hours, so it never reveals which parks interest you. Your coordinates are never sent. The service receives network information such as your IP address.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Hinweise für alle %lld US-Nationalparks kommen in einer einzigen Anfrage an developer.nps.gov, höchstens alle sechs Stunden, sodass sie nie verrät, welche Parks dich interessieren. Deine Koordinaten werden nie gesendet. Der Dienst erhält Netzwerkinformationen wie deine IP-Adresse."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alerts for all %lld U.S. national parks arrive in one request to developer.nps.gov, at most every six hours, so it never reveals which parks interest you. Your coordinates are never sent. The service receives network information such as your IP address."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las alertas de los %lld parques nacionales de EE. UU. llegan en una sola solicitud a developer.nps.gov, como máximo cada seis horas, así que nunca revela qué parques te interesan. Tus coordenadas nunca se envían. El servicio recibe información de red, como tu dirección IP."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les alertes des %lld parcs nationaux des États-Unis arrivent en une seule requête à developer.nps.gov, toutes les six heures au plus, si bien qu’elle ne révèle jamais quels parcs vous intéressent. Vos coordonnées ne sont jamais envoyées. Le service reçoit des informations réseau, comme votre adresse IP."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "米国の全%lldか所の国立公園のアラートは、developer.nps.govへの1回のリクエストでまとめて取得します。頻度は最大で6時間ごとなので、どの公園に関心があるかは伝わりません。座標が送信されることはありません。サービス側には、IPアドレスなどのネットワーク情報が届きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All night": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die ganze Nacht"
          }
        },
