            "value": "Presque pas de clair de lune"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月明かりはほとんどなし"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An early look at the clouds.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine erste Einschätzung der Wolken."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An early look at the clouds."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una vista anticipada de las nubes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une tendance pour les nuages."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雲の早めの見通しです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Approximate coordinates. Check current access, opening hours and closures with a ranger. This is not a navigation guide.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ungefähre Koordinaten. Erkundige dich bei einem Ranger nach aktuellem Zugang, Öffnungszeiten und Sperrungen. Dies ist keine Navigationshilfe."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Approximate coordinates. Check current access, opening hours and closures with a ranger. This is not a navigation guide."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coordenadas aproximadas. Confirma con un guardaparques el acceso, los horarios y los cierres actuales. Esto no es una guía de navegación."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Coordonnées approximatives. Vérifiez l’accès, les horaires et les fermetures actuels auprès d’un ranger. Ceci n’est pas un guide de navigation."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "座標はおおよそです。現在のアクセス、開場時間、閉鎖情報はレンジャーに確認してください。これはナビゲーションのための案内ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Artificial light in the sky, as a conservative Bortle estimate. It is not a measurement.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Künstliches Licht am Himmel, als vorsichtige Bortle-Schätzung. Es ist keine Messung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Artificial light in the sky, as a conservative Bortle estimate. It is not a measurement."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La luz artificial en el cielo, como una estimación conservadora en la escala de Bortle. No es una medición."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La lumière artificielle dans le ciel, en estimation prudente sur l’échelle de Bortle. Ce n’est pas une mesure."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "空に広がる人工の光を、控えめなボートル推定値で示しています。測定値ではありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "As seen from %@ at %@, its highest that night. Drag to turn it; it turns back to the face we always see.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "So, wie er von %@ aus um %@ erscheint, an seinem höchsten Punkt in dieser Nacht. Zieh, um ihn zu drehen; er dreht sich zurück zu der Seite, die wir immer sehen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As seen from %@ at %@, its highest that night. Drag to turn it; it turns back to the face we always see."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vista desde %1$@ (%2$@), a su mayor altura esa noche. Arrástrala para girarla; vuelve a la cara que siempre vemos."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vue depuis %1$@ à %2$@, à son plus haut cette nuit-là. Faites-la tourner du doigt ; elle revient à la face que nous voyons toujours."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@から%2$@に見た姿。その夜に最も高くなるときです。ドラッグすると回せます。手を離すと、いつも見えている面に戻ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At most %lld%% of the Moon's width is in shadow.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Höchstens %lld %% der Mondbreite liegen im Schatten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At most %lld%% of the Moon's width is in shadow."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Como máximo, el %lld%% del ancho de la Luna queda en sombra."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Au plus %lld %% du diamètre de la Lune est dans l’ombre."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月の幅の最大%lld%%が影に入ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "At this latitude the bright center never climbs more than %lld° up. An open view to the south matters most.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf dieser Breite steigt das helle Zentrum nie höher als %lld°. Am wichtigsten ist eine freie Sicht nach Süden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At this latitude the bright center never climbs more than %lld° up. An open view to the south matters most."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A esta latitud, el centro brillante nunca sube más de %lld°. Lo más importante es una vista despejada hacia el sur."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À cette latitude, le centre brillant ne monte jamais à plus de %lld°. Une vue dégagée vers le sud compte plus que tout."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この緯度では、天の川の明るい中心部は高度%lld°より高く昇りません。南の視界が開けていることが何より大切です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aurora comes and goes within a night, and forecasts a day or more ahead often miss.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Polarlichter kommen und gehen im Lauf einer Nacht, und Vorhersagen für einen Tag oder mehr im Voraus liegen oft daneben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aurora comes and goes within a night, and forecasts a day or more ahead often miss."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La aurora aparece y desaparece durante la noche, y los pronósticos con un día o más de antelación a menudo fallan."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les aurores vont et viennent au cours d’une nuit, et les prévisions à un jour ou plus se trompent souvent."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オーロラは一晩のうちに現れたり消えたりし、1日以上先の予報はよく外れます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Aurora forecast": {
