          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Lune se lève déjà éclipsée."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月は欠けた状態で昇ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Moon sets before it ends.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Mond geht unter, bevor sie endet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Moon sets before it ends."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Luna se pone antes de que termine."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Lune se couche avant la fin."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終わる前に月が沈みます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Moon's phase and the next new moon, when the darkest nights begin.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Mondphase und der nächste Neumond, wenn die dunkelsten Nächte beginnen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Moon's phase and the next new moon, when the darkest nights begin."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fase de la Luna y la próxima luna nueva, cuando empiezan las noches más oscuras."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La phase de la Lune et la prochaine nouvelle lune, quand commencent les nuits les plus sombres."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月の満ち欠けと次の新月。いちばん暗い夜が始まる時期です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Moon: NASA's Scientific Visualization Studio, CGI Moon Kit, with the LRO LROC (Hapke Normalized WAC Mosaic) and LOLA teams.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Mond: Scientific Visualization Studio der NASA, CGI Moon Kit, mit den LRO-Teams LROC (Hapke Normalized WAC Mosaic) und LOLA."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Moon: NASA's Scientific Visualization Studio, CGI Moon Kit, with the LRO LROC (Hapke Normalized WAC Mosaic) and LOLA teams."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Luna: Scientific Visualization Studio de la NASA, CGI Moon Kit, con los equipos LRO LROC (Hapke Normalized WAC Mosaic) y LOLA."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Lune : Scientific Visualization Studio de la NASA, CGI Moon Kit, avec les équipes LRO LROC (Hapke Normalized WAC Mosaic) et LOLA."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月：NASA Scientific Visualization Studio、CGI Moon Kit、LRO LROC（Hapke Normalized WAC Mosaic）およびLOLAチーム。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The North Unit keeps Central Time, one hour ahead of the times Nyx shows for this park.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die North Unit nutzt die Central Time, eine Stunde voraus gegenüber den Zeiten, die Nyx für diesen Park zeigt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The North Unit keeps Central Time, one hour ahead of the times Nyx shows for this park."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Unidad Norte usa la hora del Centro, una hora más que las horas que Nyx muestra para este parque."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La North Unit est à l’heure du Centre, une heure de plus que les heures que Nyx affiche pour ce parc."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "North Unitは中部時間を使っていて、Nyxがこの公園に表示する時刻より1時間進んでいます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Sun is up": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Sonne steht am Himmel"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Sun is up"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es de día"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le Soleil est levé"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太陽が出ています"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Sun stays up all night.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Sonne geht die ganze Nacht nicht unter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Sun stays up all night."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El Sol no se pone en toda la noche."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le Soleil reste levé toute la nuit."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太陽は一晩中沈みません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The air is usually near its dew point before dawn this month: expect dew on lenses.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In diesem Monat ist die Luft vor der Morgendämmerung meist nahe ihrem Taupunkt: Rechne mit Tau auf den Linsen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The air is usually near its dew point before dawn this month: expect dew on lenses."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Este mes, antes del amanecer, el aire suele estar cerca de su punto de rocío: es probable que se forme rocío en los lentes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce mois-ci, avant l’aube, l’air est en général proche de son point de rosée : attendez-vous à de la rosée sur les optiques."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この月は夜明け前の空気がたいてい露点に近く、レンズに夜露がつきやすくなります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bright center is near the Sun this season. The Milky Way's fainter band still crosses dark skies.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das helle Zentrum steht in dieser Jahreszeit nahe der Sonne. Das schwächere Band der Milchstraße zieht trotzdem über dunkle Himmel."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bright center is near the Sun this season. The Milky Way's fainter band still crosses dark skies."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En esta temporada, el centro brillante está cerca del Sol. La banda más tenue de la Vía Láctea aún cruza los cielos oscuros."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le centre brillant est proche du Soleil en cette saison. La bande plus pâle de la Voie lactée traverse tout de même les ciels noirs."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この季節、明るい中心部は太陽の近くにあります。より淡い天の川の帯は、暗い空を横切ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bright center is out of the night sky this season. Bright constellations still reward a dark night.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das helle Zentrum ist in dieser Jahreszeit nicht am Nachthimmel. Helle Sternbilder lohnen eine dunkle Nacht trotzdem."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bright center is out of the night sky this season. Bright constellations still reward a dark night."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "En esta temporada, el centro brillante no está en el cielo nocturno. Las constelaciones brillantes aún recompensan una noche oscura."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le centre brillant est absent du ciel nocturne en cette saison. Les constellations brillantes récompensent tout de même une nuit noire."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この季節、明るい中心部は夜空に出ていません。それでも暗い夜には、明るい星座が楽しめます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bright center may be visible before dawn or near dusk. Timing and terrain matter.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das helle Zentrum ist vielleicht vor der Morgendämmerung oder nahe der Abenddämmerung sichtbar. Zeitpunkt und Gelände sind wichtig."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bright center may be visible before dawn or near dusk. Timing and terrain matter."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El centro brillante puede verse antes del amanecer o cerca del anochecer. Importan la hora y el terreno."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le centre brillant peut être visible avant l’aube ou peu après le crépuscule. L’heure et le relief comptent."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明るい中心部は、夜明け前か夕暮れ近くに見えるかもしれません。時間帯と地形が大切です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bright center rises at %@, after true darkness ends at %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das helle Zentrum geht um %@ auf, nachdem die echte Dunkelheit um %@ endet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bright center rises at %@, after true darkness ends at %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El centro brillante sale (%1$@), después de que termina la oscuridad total (%2$@)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le centre brillant se lève à %1$@, après la fin de l’obscurité totale à %2$@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明るい中心部は%1$@に昇ります。完全な暗さが%2$@に終わった後です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bright center sets at %@, before true darkness begins at %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das helle Zentrum geht um %@ unter, bevor die echte Dunkelheit um %@ beginnt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bright center sets at %@, before true darkness begins at %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El centro brillante se pone (%1$@), antes de que empiece la oscuridad total (%2$@)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le centre brillant se couche à %1$@, avant le début de l’obscurité totale à %2$@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明るい中心部は%1$@に沈みます。完全な暗さが%2$@に始まる前です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bright center stays low on the horizon at this latitude. An open view to the south matters most.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf dieser Breite bleibt das helle Zentrum tief am Horizont. Am wichtigsten ist eine freie Sicht nach Süden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The bright center stays low on the horizon at this latitude. An open view to the south matters most."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A esta latitud, el centro brillante se queda bajo en el horizonte. Lo más importante es una vista despejada hacia el sur."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le centre brillant reste bas sur l’horizon à cette latitude. Une vue dégagée vers le sud compte plus que tout."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この緯度では、明るい中心部は地平線近くの低い空にとどまります。南の視界が開けていることが何より大切です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The darkest nights of the month come in the week around it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die dunkelsten Nächte des Monats liegen in der Woche um ihn herum."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The darkest nights of the month come in the week around it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las noches más oscuras del mes llegan en la semana alrededor de ella."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les nuits les plus noires du mois tombent dans la semaine qui l’entoure."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月のうちいちばん暗い夜は、その前後の1週間にあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The longest night of the year": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die längste Nacht des Jahres"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The longest night of the year"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La noche más larga del año"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nuit la plus longue de l’année"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一年で最も長い夜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next seven nights": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die nächsten sieben Nächte"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The next seven nights"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las próximas siete noches"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les sept prochaines nuits"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この先7夜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next seven nights: %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die nächsten sieben Nächte: %@."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The next seven nights: %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las próximas siete noches: %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les sept prochaines nuits : %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この先7夜：%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The peak falls in daylight or twilight here, so only the edges of it reach a dark sky.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Maximum fällt hier in Tageslicht oder Dämmerung, daher erreichen nur seine Ränder einen dunklen Himmel."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The peak falls in daylight or twilight here, so only the edges of it reach a dark sky."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí el máximo cae de día o durante el crepúsculo, así que solo sus extremos llegan a un cielo oscuro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ici, le maximum tombe de jour ou au crépuscule, si bien que seules ses marges profitent d’un ciel noir."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここでは極大が昼間か薄明の時間に重なるため、暗い空で見られるのはその前後だけです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The peak falls while the radiant is low here, so few meteors reach this sky.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Maximum fällt hier in eine Zeit, in der der Radiant tief steht, daher erreichen wenige Meteore diesen Himmel."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The peak falls while the radiant is low here, so few meteors reach this sky."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aquí el máximo llega con el radiante bajo, así que pocos meteoros alcanzan este cielo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ici, le maximum tombe alors que le radiant est bas, si bien que peu de météores atteignent ce ciel."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ここでは極大のとき放射点が低いため、この空に届く流星はわずかです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The public coordinates and park codes of the %lld national parks. Nothing about you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die öffentlichen Koordinaten und Parkcodes der %lld Nationalparks. Nichts über dich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The public coordinates and park codes of the %lld national parks. Nothing about you."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las coordenadas públicas y los códigos de los %lld parques nacionales. Nada sobre ti."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les coordonnées publiques et les codes des %lld parcs nationaux. Rien sur vous."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lldの国立公園の公開座標と公園コードだけです。あなたについての情報は含まれません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die veröffentlichte Maximalrate beträgt %lld pro Stunde unter einem perfekten Himmel, mit dem Radianten, dem Punkt, aus dem die Meteore zu kommen scheinen, direkt über dir (International Meteor Organization)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tasa máxima publicada es de %lld por hora con un cielo perfecto y el radiante, el punto del que parecen salir los meteoros, en el cenit (Organización Internacional de Meteoros)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le taux maximal publié est de %lld par heure sous un ciel parfait, avec le radiant, le point d’où semblent venir les météores, au zénith (International Meteor Organization)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公表されている極大時の出現数は、理想的な空で、放射点（流星が飛び出してくるように見える点）が天頂にあるとき、1時間に%lld個です（国際流星機構）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization); it varies from year to year.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die veröffentlichte Maximalrate beträgt %lld pro Stunde unter einem perfekten Himmel, mit dem Radianten, dem Punkt, aus dem die Meteore zu kommen scheinen, direkt über dir (International Meteor Organization); sie schwankt von Jahr zu Jahr."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The published peak rate is %lld an hour under a perfect sky, with the radiant, the point the meteors seem to come from, overhead (International Meteor Organization); it varies from year to year."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tasa máxima publicada es de %lld por hora con un cielo perfecto y el radiante, el punto del que parecen salir los meteoros, en el cenit (Organización Internacional de Meteoros); varía de un año a otro."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le taux maximal publié est de %lld par heure sous un ciel parfait, avec le radiant, le point d’où semblent venir les météores, au zénith (International Meteor Organization) ; il varie d’une année à l’autre."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "公表されている極大時の出現数は、理想的な空で、放射点（流星が飛び出してくるように見える点）が天頂にあるとき、1時間に%lld個です（国際流星機構）。年によって変わります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shortest night of the year": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
